`s 485.2(3) the application states the reasons required` MEANS
    IF `the application states the reasons why the measurements, processes or operations were not completed`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The application must state the reasons why the measurements, processes or operations were not completed."

-- 485.2(4) A justice or judge may proceed ex parte to determine an application made under subsection (1).
-- src:8751 | Ex parte application
-- src:8752 | (4) A justice or judge may proceed ex parte to determine an application made under subsection (1).
